(66457: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%20Source%20register%20of%20issue%20%23195%3A%20the%20issue%20and%20every%20requirement-bearing%0A%2F%2F%20comment%20of%20the%20original%20and%20remaining-scope%20discussions%2C%20each%20with%20the%20revision%20%28updatedAt%2C%20byte%20count%0A%2F%2F%20and%20sha256%20of%20the%20exact%20body%20the%20GitHub%20REST%20API%20returns%29%20that%20the%20atomic%0A%2F%2F%20ledger%20in%20parity%2Fissue-195-requirements.json%20was%20reconciled%20against.%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20Editing%20a%20registered%20comment%20changes%20its%20hash%2C%20and%20a%20comment%20that%20is%20neither%0A%2F%2F%20registered%20nor%20recognized%20as%20automation%20output%20is%20reported%20as%20unregistered%2C%0A%2F%2F%20so%20the%20ledger%20cannot%20silently%20keep%20a%20stale%20or%20incomplete%20requirement%20snapshot.%0A%2F%2F%20The%20offline%20check%20%28the%20default%29%20validates%20the%20committed%20register%20against%20the%0A%2F%2F%20ledger%20and%20captured%20direct%20instructions%3B%20%60--online%60%20also%20compares%20it%20with%0A%2F%2F%20the%20live%20issue%20%23195%2F%23199%20and%20pull%20request%20%23196%2F%23201%20discussions.%0Aimport%20%7B%20execFileSync%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Achild_process%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20createHash%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Acrypto%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20readFile%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Afs%2Fpromises%27%3B%0Aimport%20path%20from%20%27node%3Apath%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20fileURLToPath%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Aurl%27%3B%0A%0Aexport%20const%20ISSUE_195_SOURCE_REGISTER_PATH%20%3D%20%27parity%2Fissue-195-sources.json%27%3B%0Aexport%20const%20ISSUE_195_SOURCE_REGISTER_SCHEMA_VERSION%20%3D%201%3B%0A%0Aconst%20REPOSITORY%20%3D%20%27link-foundation%2Fmeta-language%27%3B%0Aexport%20const%20TRACKED_ISSUES%20%3D%20Object.freeze%28%5B195%2C%20199%2C%20224%5D%29%3B%0Aexport%20const%20TRACKED_PULL_REQUESTS%20%3D%20Object.freeze%28%5B196%2C%20201%2C%20226%5D%29%3B%0Aconst%20REPOSITORY_ROOT%20%3D%20path.resolve%28path.dirname%28fileURLToPath%28import.meta.url%29%29%2C%20%27..%27%2C%20%27..%27%29%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20Actual%20direct%20conversation%20captures.%20Appending%20these%20declarations%20never%0A%2F%2F%20rewrites%20an%20earlier%20live%20source%2C%20capture%2C%20timestamp%20or%20ledger%20mapping.%0Aexport%20const%20ASSERTION_POLICY_INSTRUCTION_SOURCES%20%3D%20Object.freeze%28%5B%0A%20%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20id%3A%20%27modern-javascript-parity-expectations-2026-10-16%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20key%3A%20%27modernJavaScriptParityRequest%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20title%3A%20%27Use%20newer%20JavaScript%20behavior%20and%20correct%20obsolete%20native%20expectations%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20role%3A%20%27Explicit%20user%20resolution%20of%20the%20retained%20Rust%20versus%20JavaScript%20string%20length%20and%20array%20bounds%20expectation%20conflict%2C%20with%20the%20exact%20question%20and%20reply.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20ledgerCoverage%3A%20%5B%27I195-PARITY-MODERN-JAVASCRIPT-ARRAY-BEHAVIOR%27%2C%20%27I195-PARITY-OBSOLETE-NATIVE-EXPECTATIONS%27%5D%2C%0A%20%20%7D%2C%0A%20%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20id%3A%20%27compact-contributor-instructions-and-assertion-corrections-2026-10-16%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20key%3A%20%27compactContributorInstructionsRequest%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20title%3A%20%27Minimize%20contributor%20instructions%20and%20permit%20evidence%20based%20assertion%20corrections%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20role%3A%20%27Direct%20user%20request%20to%20shorten%20AGENTS.md%20and%20CLAUDE.md%20without%20losing%20obligations%20and%20to%20allow%20genuinely%20wrong%20assertions%20to%20be%20fixed.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20ledgerCoverage%3A%20%5B%27I195-CONTRIBUTOR-INSTRUCTIONS-CONCISE%27%2C%20%27I195-ASSERTION-EVIDENCE-BASED-CORRECTION%27%5D%2C%0A%20%20%7D%2C%0A%20%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20id%3A%20%27version-bounded-assertions-2026-10-16%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20key%3A%20%27versionBoundedAssertionsRequest%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20title%3A%20%27Bound%20version%20dependent%20assertions%20to%20the%20actual%20active%20language%20or%20dependency%20version%27%2C%