mplement%20all%20unmet%20requirements%20and%20CI%20repairs%20while%20awaiting%20the%20next%20CI%20result%3B%20retain%20the%20complete%20scope%20and%20continue%20working%20during%20verification.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20ledgerCoverage%3A%20%5B%27I195-WORKFLOW-FAST-CONTINUOUS-PROGRESS%27%2C%20%27I195-WORKFLOW-BULK-EXACT-SCOPE%27%5D%2C%0A%20%20%7D%2C%0A%20%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20id%3A%20%27automation-first-own-codebase-baseline-2026-10-21%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20key%3A%20%27automationFirstOwnCodebaseBaselineRequest%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20title%3A%20%27Automate%20high%20coverage%20work%20and%20prioritize%20complete%20JavaScript%20Rust%20translation%20of%20this%20codebase%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20role%3A%20%27Direct%20user%20priority%20for%20automation%20and%20twenty%20percent%20resource%20investment%20toward%20eighty%20percent%20results%2C%20up%20to%20three%20subagents%20in%20the%20current%20phase%2C%20and%20full%20JavaScript%20and%20Rust%20parsing%2C%20emission%20and%20bidirectional%20own-codebase%20translation%20as%20the%20baseline%20before%20the%20remaining%20capabilities.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20ledgerCoverage%3A%20%5B%27I195-WORKFLOW-AUTOMATION-FIRST-COVERAGE%27%2C%20%27I195-WORKFLOW-THREE-SUBAGENT-CURRENT-PHASE%27%2C%20%27I195-TRANSLATION-OWN-CODEBASE-BASELINE%27%5D%2C%0A%20%20%7D%2C%0A%20%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20id%3A%20%27solo-continuation-2026-10-21%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20key%3A%20%27latestSoloContinuationRequest%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20title%3A%20%27Finish%20all%20existing%20agents%20and%20continue%20the%20current%20phase%20alone%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20role%3A%20%27Latest%20direct%20user%20instruction%20supersedes%20the%20earlier%20three-agent%20allowance%20for%20this%20task%20phase%3A%20allow%20existing%20agents%20to%20finish%20and%20continue%20as%20coordinator%20without%20spawning%20or%20reactivating%20agents.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20ledgerCoverage%3A%20%5B%27I195-WORKFLOW-GRADUAL-AGENT-REDUCTION%27%5D%2C%0A%20%20%7D%2C%0A%5D.map%28source%20%3D%3E%20Object.freeze%28%7B%20...source%2C%20ledgerCoverag