ort%20function%20restoreProgramStringSourceDescriptorEdge%28artifact%2Cidentity%2Cregister%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%28%7Bartifact%2Cregister%7D%3DrestoreOwnCodebaseRawDescriptorEdge%28artifact%2Cidentity%2Cregister%29%29%3B%0A%20%20if%28%21Object.hasOwn%28register%2Cproperty%29%29return%7Bartifact%2Cregister%7D%3B%0A%20%20const%20selected%3DreadProgramStringSourceDescriptorPolicy%28%29%3Bassert.deepEqual%28register%5Bproperty%5D%2C%5Bselected.edge%5D%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20bytes%3DBuffer.from%28serializeProjectData%28register%2Cselected.register.file%29%29%3Bassert.deepEqual%28pin%28bytes%29%2Cselected.register.current%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20previousRegister%3D%7B...register%7D%3Bdelete%20previousRegister%5Bproperty%5D%3B%0A%20%20const%20originalRegister%3DBuffer.from%28serializeProjectData%28previousRegister%2Cselected.register.file%29%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.deepEqual%28pin%28originalRegister%29%2C%7Bbytes%3Aselected.register.bytes%2Csha256%3Aselected.register.sha256%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.equal%28originalRegister.toString%28%27utf8%27%29%2Cselected.register.sourceText%29%3B%0A%20%20verifyGitArtifactCertificate%28selected.register.certificate%2CoriginalRegister%2C%7Brevision%2Cpath%3Aselected.register.file%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20if%28identity%21%3D%3D%27raw%20consuming%27%7C%7Cartifact%3D%3D%3Dnull%29return%7Bartifact%2Cregister%3AstructuredClone%28previousRegister%29%7D%3B%0A%20%20const%20current%3DBuffer.from%28serializeProjectData%28artifact%2Cselected.artifact.file%29%29%3B%0A%20%20if%28pin%28current%29.sha256%21%3D%3Dselected.edge.current.sha256%29return%7Bartifact%2Cregister%3AstructuredClone%28previousRegister%29%7D%3B%0A%20%20assert.deepEqual%28pin%28current%29%2Cselected.edge.current%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20owner%3Dselected.sourceOwner%3B%0A%20%20assert.deepEqual%28pin%28readFileSync%28new%20URL%28owner.file%2Croot%29%29%29%2Cowner.current%2C%27the%20actual%20checked-program%20projection%20source%20remains%20exact%27%29%3B%0A%20%20verifyGitArtifactCertificate%28owner.certif