port%20interface%20SelfTranslationOptions%20%7B%0A%20%20%2F%2A%2A%20Uses%20one%20UTF-16%20string%20representation%20across%20all%20emitted%20module%20items.%20%2A%2F%0A%20%20readonly%20utf16Strings%3F%3A%20boolean%3B%0A%20%20%2F%2A%2A%20Forces%20shared%20reference%20values%20across%20module%20items%3B%20observable%20identity%20and%20mutation%20also%20select%20them%20automatically.%20%2A%2F%0A%20%20readonly%20referenceSemantics%3F%3A%20boolean%3B%0A%20%20%2F%2A%2A%20Emitter%20decorators%20applied%20to%20each%20translated%20item.%20%2A%2F%0A%20%20readonly%20decorators%3F%3A%20unknown%3B%0A%20%20%2F%2A%2A%20The%20module%27s%20directory%20inside%20its%20crate%2C%20as%20path%20segments%3B%20the%20crate%20root%20by%20default.%20%2A%2F%0A%20%20readonly%20moduleDirectory%3F%3A%20readonly%20string%5B%5D%3B%0A%20%20%2F%2A%2A%20The%20signatures%20%60selfTranslationSignatures%60%20gives%20for%20each%20imported%20module%2C%20by%20import%20specifier.%20%2A%2F%0A%20%20readonly%20imports%3F%3A%20Readonly%3CRecord%3Cstring%2C%20readonly%20SelfTranslationSignature%5B%5D%3E%3E%3B%0A%7D%0Aexport%20interface%20TypeScriptErasure%20%7B%0A%20%20start%3A%20number%3B%0A%20%20end%3A%20number%3B%0A%20%20term%3A%20string%3B%0A%7D%0Aexport%20interface%20ErasedTypeScript%20%7B%0A%20%20code%3A%20string%3B%0A%20%20erasures%3A%20TypeScriptErasure%5B%5D%3B%0A%7D%0Aexport%20function%20eraseTypeScript%28source%3A%20string%29%3A%20ErasedTypeScript%3B%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Projects%20supported%20TypeScript%20compile-time%20annotations%20into%20the%20shared%20JavaScript%20frontend%27s%20JSDoc%20form.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20projectTypeScriptTyping%28source%3A%20string%29%3A%20string%3B%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%0A%20%2A%20Translates%20one%20of%20meta-language%27s%20own%20modules%20between%20JavaScript%2C%0A%20%2A%20TypeScript%20and%20Rust%20through%20links%3A%20same-language%20translation%20is%20byte%20for%0A%20%2A%20byte%2C%20and%20translating%20an%20unedited%20translation%20back%20restores%20the%20source.%0A%20%2A%